&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Antora is hiring a Director of Grid Policy to lead regional and state-level regulatory advocacy on transmission, interconnection, and resource adequacy issues that are critical to the commercial success of Antora&#39;s long-duration storage and 24/7 energy products. This person will manage high-level negotiations and policy advocacy with RTOs, public utility commissions, and state legislatures, partnering closely with Antora&#39;s policy team and the energy commercial team (led by the Director of Energy) to ensure Antora&#39;s technology receives accurate, favorable regulatory treatment as the company scales into new products, states, and RTOs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
