&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The HR &amp;amp; Site Administrator will own day-to-day operations, shipments, site-visit logistics, and HR support, enabling the team to execute on mission-critical work.&amp;nbsp; This is an in-person role in Pratt, Kansas. You are responsible for partnering with the Site Manager and the team that is based onsite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
